  "details": "So.. I co own a group and mod another group and we often have big \"cross over\" events / parties / game nights. BUT it has to be hosted as a group+ by ONE of the groups. And sometimes we do bigger things with other groups (4+).\n\nI have no idea if it would be possible, but it would be so nice if we had the ability to make the instances group+ for multiple groups at once (kind of how like in a group instance you can select certain roles to allow in that instance) as long as the person making the instance has the permission in each group to make an instance.",
